        "name": "Enshrined: Sword of Fates",
        "steam_appid": 3835610,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/16fa650a4aaae118da56c615bce749b4.avif?t=1765550864\" width=616 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are a seasoned adventurer in pursuit of the fabled Sword of Cietri, a mystical blade that only appears once every 100 years for just 24 hours. At the penultimate moment of success, a sudden mysterious voice informs you that the sword’s power can only be unlocked by &quot;joining with another in body and spirit…&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...and your only choices are three strangers who, by a convergence of fates, were also seeking the fabled blade, and moments ago were just trying to kill you.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enshrined is a fully-voiced dark fantasy visual novel that gives the player the chance to decide their fate and who, ultimately, will leave with the coveted sword.</strong>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three distinct character backgrounds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/f60581bbbdb7df8ae863237cba8cadf6.avif?t=1765550864\" width=616 height=290 /></span> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JYNDI</strong>: A hardy warrior people locked in a struggle with oblivion.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/b88d5a000b265117293122e77ccc2bd3.avif?t=1765550864\" width=616 height=290 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FALLEN</strong>: Angels cast from the heavens and banished by their divine masters.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/fab16a96037f397a5b7a9bf7123ae93d.avif?t=1765550864\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HUMAN</strong>: Resourceful adventurers imbued with a talent for magic.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring unique dialogue across all three distinct story routes, with multiple possible endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect CGs across 3 different routes, one good end and 6 bonus illustrations per route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features gamepad rumble support for an enhanced... <strong>tactile</strong> experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enshrined is fully-voiced by a veteran cast, featuring the talents of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SungWon Cho</strong> as Jun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jonah Scott</strong> as Niko.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dave Fennoy</strong> as Dyma.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Note: <strong>No generative or assistive AI was used at any point in the production of this game;</strong> This includes artwork, music, programming, voice acting, and QA.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/16fa650a4aaae118da56c615bce749b4.avif?t=1765550864\" width=616 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are a seasoned adventurer in pursuit of the fabled Sword of Cietri, a mystical blade that only appears once every 100 years for just 24 hours. At the penultimate moment of success, a sudden mysterious voice informs you that the sword’s power can only be unlocked by &quot;joining with another in body and spirit…&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...and your only choices are three strangers who, by a convergence of fates, were also seeking the fabled blade, and moments ago were just trying to kill you.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enshrined is a fully-voiced dark fantasy visual novel that gives the player the chance to decide their fate and who, ultimately, will leave with the coveted sword.</strong>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three distinct character backgrounds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/f60581bbbdb7df8ae863237cba8cadf6.avif?t=1765550864\" width=616 height=290 /></span> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JYNDI</strong>: A hardy warrior people locked in a struggle with oblivion.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/b88d5a000b265117293122e77ccc2bd3.avif?t=1765550864\" width=616 height=290 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FALLEN</strong>: Angels cast from the heavens and banished by their divine masters.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/fab16a96037f397a5b7a9bf7123ae93d.avif?t=1765550864\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HUMAN</strong>: Resourceful adventurers imbued with a talent for magic.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring unique dialogue across all three distinct story routes, with multiple possible endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect CGs across 3 different routes, one good end and 6 bonus illustrations per route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features gamepad rumble support for an enhanced... <strong>tactile</strong> experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enshrined is fully-voiced by a veteran cast, featuring the talents of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SungWon Cho</strong> as Jun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jonah Scott</strong> as Niko.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dave Fennoy</strong> as Dyma.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Note: <strong>No generative or assistive AI was used at any point in the production of this game;</strong> This includes artwork, music, programming, voice acting, and QA.</p>",
        "short_description": "Once every 100 years, a temple containing a legendary blade appears for only 24 hours. The sword’s power can only be unlocked joining in body and spirit with another, and there are three men hoping to be chosen to share the sword’s power with you. Who will it be?",
